              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Where authZ lives",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Gateway: ==coarse authN== and basic scopes only",
                "Every service enforces its own ==fine-grained authZ==",
                "{red:Defense in depth}: the gateway can be bypassed or misconfigured"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Model",
