            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Check ==ownership== in the service: user reads only their own order",
                "Missing it = **BOLA/IDOR**, the top API vulnerability",
                "Externalize policy with ==OPA (Rego)== or ==Cedar==, as sidecar or library",
                "Policy is versioned and consistent; decision = ==allow/deny== per request"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
